WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.193 --> 00:00:14.180
"Who are Swift Wing and the Demon of Black Rain?"

2
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:15.261
Roxy thought.

3
00:00:15.861 --> 00:00:17.762
And where had this crazy monkey come from?

4
00:00:18.763 --> 00:00:20.924
Roxy saw Wukong mutter something to himself.

5
00:00:22.946 --> 00:00:27.109
Then she gasped as Wukong began growing tall—really tall!

6
00:00:27.429 --> 00:00:29.630
He soon towered above the city buildings.

7
00:00:30.431 --> 00:00:31.151
Roxy gulped.

8
00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:36.888
"How can you The giant Wukong grabbed her and held her up in front of his face.

9
00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:40.611
"Oh, I guess I didn't tell you," he said with a smile.

10
00:00:40.631 --> 00:00:45.516
"I can grow to any size I want!"

11
00:00:46.536 --> 00:00:48.358
Wukong threw Roxy up in the air.

12
00:00:48.378 --> 00:00:50.900
"So long, Rocket Girl!"

13
00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.501
He swung his iron bar.

14
00:00:52.782 --> 00:00:56.525
Pow! Tumbling and spinning, Roxy soared into the sky.

15
00:00:56.545 --> 00:01:00.088
"Whoa! I can't stop!"

16
00:01:00.692 --> 00:01:03.695
Roxy said as she shot up past the clouds and kept going.

17
00:01:04.455 --> 00:01:08.458
The sky grew darker and darker until Roxy was above Earth's atmosphere.

18
00:01:08.478 --> 00:01:10.900
"I'm in outer space!"

19
00:01:11.341 --> 00:01:12.001
Roxy cried.

20
00:01:13.102 --> 00:01:15.724
Finally she slowed down and started falling back toward Earth.

21
00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:18.406
Roxy fell faster and faster.

22
00:01:18.426 --> 00:01:23.070
Boomf! She landed in a deep snowdrift in the mountains.

23
00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:26.993
"Wow," Roxy thought.

24
00:01:27.013 --> 00:01:29.876
"Wukong is incredibly powerful!"

25
00:01:30.948 --> 00:01:31.628
"Rocket Girl!"

26
00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:32.709
a voice called.

27
00:01:32.729 --> 00:01:34.569
"Are you okay?"

28
00:01:35.469 --> 00:01:38.730
A park ranger hurried over and pulled Roxy out of the snowdrift.

29
00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.151
"Thanks," Roxy said.

30
00:01:41.171 --> 00:01:46.212
"I'm okay I'm trying to fight—" The park ranger gasped and pointed.

31
00:01:46.232 --> 00:01:48.773
"A really big monkey!"

32
00:01:49.953 --> 00:01:53.614
Roxy spun around and saw the giant Wukong flying down toward her.

33
00:01:54.434 --> 00:01:56.695
His iron bar was held high, ready to strike!

34
00:01:56.715 --> 00:01:58.776
"Get out of the way!"

35
00:01:59.176 --> 00:02:00.156
Roxy warned the ranger.

36
00:02:00.992 --> 00:02:03.394
The ranger ran as Roxy flew at Wukong.

37
00:02:04.735 --> 00:02:06.936
Pow! Roxy hit the monkey hard.

38
00:02:07.697 --> 00:02:09.618
He fell backward, and the mountain shook.

39
00:02:10.359 --> 00:02:13.361
An avalanche of snow rushed downward.

40
00:02:13.381 --> 00:02:15.702
"Ahh!" The ranger screamed.

41
00:02:16.843 --> 00:02:19.765
Roxy flew fast to grab the ranger and move her out of the way.

42
00:02:21.226 --> 00:02:24.429
When Roxy saw Wukong again, he was his regular size.

43
00:02:24.449 --> 00:02:27.951
"What is he doing now?"

44
00:02:28.391 --> 00:02:29.052
Roxy thought.

45
00:02:29.632 --> 00:02:32.994
The strange monkey yanked out a few of his own hairs and blew on them.

46
00:02:33.594 --> 00:02:34.475
Wukong grinned.

47
00:02:34.495 --> 00:02:37.897
"This spell is called Body Beyond the Body!"

48
00:02:41.579 --> 00:02:44.641
Roxy screamed as a whole bunch of tiny Wukongs attacked her.

49
00:02:48.983 --> 00:02:52.765
Roxy punched and kicked, sending the Wukongs flying in all directions.

50
00:02:53.446 --> 00:02:54.727
But more kept attacking her.

51
00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.722
Whiz-hoo! Her eye laser beams zapped several tiny Wukongs.

52
00:03:00.523 --> 00:03:04.927
Whoo-oo-oosh! Her super breath blew more away, but others kept coming!

53
00:03:07.109 --> 00:03:07.870
Roxy groaned.

54
00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:12.113
"This is bad—how will I defeat Wukong?"

55
00:03:12.474 --> 00:03:12.974
she thought.

56
00:03:13.615 --> 00:03:14.515
Wukong groaned.

57
00:03:15.797 --> 00:03:17.938
"This is bad," he thought.

58
00:03:17.958 --> 00:03:22.122
"The goddess definitely can't destroy me, but I can't destroy her either.

59
00:03:22.643 --> 00:03:23.924
How will I get rid of her?"

60
00:03:25.024 --> 00:03:27.125
He tapped his chin, contemplating the problem.

61
00:03:27.145 --> 00:03:28.126
"I know!"

62
00:03:30.227 --> 00:03:33.949
Wukong quietly recited a spell and then called out to the tiny Wukongs.

63
00:03:33.969 --> 00:03:35.610
"Return to me!"

64
00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.072
All the tiny Wukongs hurried back to Wukong.

65
00:03:39.092 --> 00:03:45.015
"Ha! You're all afraid of me," Roxy cried, shooting after the tiny Wukongs.

66
00:03:45.776 --> 00:03:47.757
She headed straight toward the real Wukong.

67
00:03:48.357 --> 00:03:50.218
Roxy made a fist, ready to strike.

68
00:03:50.858 --> 00:03:53.480
Just as she reached the monkey, he stepped aside.

69
00:03:54.064 --> 00:03:58.188
Behind him, the portal was open, and Roxy flew right through!

70
00:03:58.789 --> 00:04:03.713
Wukong closed the portal—zoomp!—and then chuckled.

71
00:04:03.733 --> 00:04:06.036
"No more Rocket Girl!"
